  "notes": "Cash basis county, FY ended 6/30/2023, governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Statement lines from the Statement of Receipts, Disbursements, and Changes in Fund Balances - Governmental Funds (p4), Total Governmental Funds column. 'Taxes' 3,096,886 split using the Statement of Activities general receipts (p2): Property 2,864,235 + Motor vehicle 176,573 + Lodging 56,078 = 3,096,886 exactly. 'Local' 1,259,617 kept as one line (other; context label). Fund balances recorded as fund balances: beginning as originally stated 7,068,596, prior period adjustment (Note 13) 340,674 as an adjustment, ending 5,304,437 (p4). Beginning cash not printed; ending_cash = Cash + Restricted cash (p3). Bond proceeds 735,000 (Ambulance 225,000, Ambulance Building 510,000) under other financing -> debt_proceeds. Transfers: General out 1,114,986 = Road in 1,100,000 + Reappraisal in 14,986; Highway Buyback out 283,304 = Highway Bond in 283,304. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1); fund balance by classification. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p9; General Fund column only), Inheritance Tax Fund and Veterans Aid Fund columns from the General Fund combining statement (p5), Road and Capital Projects budget schedules (pp10-11), nonmajor funds (18 funds) from the combining statement Total Non-Major Funds column (p8). Nonmajor Taxes split into lodging (Visitor Promotion and Visitor Improvement fund names, ties to SoA Lodging) and an unlabeled remainder (Hospital Bond 359,956 + Reappraisal 13). Read pages 1-11 of 11"
